<title>USA: TABLE - Gencor Q3 revs, net, share up a bit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Gencor Q3 revs, net, share up a bit.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	  3 Months Ended		 9 Months Ended</p>
<p>	   June 30th			    June 30th</p>
<p>			 1996				   1996</p>
<p>     1997   Proforma    Actual	 1997    Proforma   Actual</p>
<p>Net Revenue</p>
<p> $ 51,079     46,085    21,722    135,015     120,184   47,416</p>
<p>Operating Income</p>
<p>    5,506	5,338     2,919     11,674	10,956    4,437</p>
