<p>    2,336	2,298     1,579	4,479	 3,738    2,156</p>
<p>EPS</p>
<p>     0.48	 0.47	0.44	 0.95	  0.77     0.60</p>
<p>NOTES: Effective September 30, 1996, the company bought the stock of the process equipment division of Ingersoll-Rand Co, known as CPM. The results of operations of CPM have been included in the results of the company from October 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Pro forma 1996 data assumes the acquisition had occurred on October 1, 1995.</p>
<p>Full co name is Gencor Industries Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610.</p>
